OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pays tribute to girl who
OL,4,Adied in River Wear
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a 16-year-old girl, who
OL,7,Fdied when the car she was in ended up
OL,8,Fin a river has paid tribute to their
OL,9,F"beautiful girl".
OL,11,FSixteen-year-olds Luke Etheridge and
OL,12,FZara Shaw died along with Jackson Duke,
OL,13,F17, when the black Audi A3 they were in
OL,14,Fcame off the road at Panns Bank near
OL,15,FWearmouth Bridge, Sunderland, and
OL,16,Fplunged into the Wear just before 13:30
OL,17,FBST on Tuesday.
OL,19,FZara's family said she made them proud
OL,20,F"from day one" and had an "infectious
OL,21,Flaugh and smile".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
