OL,3,GNEWSAFamily pays tribute to girl who
OL,4,Adied in River Wear
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlains Farm Youth and Community Centre,
OL,7,Fwhere Luke was a member, said he left a
OL,8,F"lasting impression" on those around
OL,9,Fhim, while Hebburn Town FC, where
OL,10,FJackson played in the U18s team, said
OL,11,Fhis loss would be "deeply felt".
